Z||000000||N_Man||04-27-2000||01:54 AM||||I was wondering if anybody has had problems with a broken crankshaft in a V6?<P>The parts guy at a local performance shop told me that if they are revved enough they will usually break.  If this is true(hopeing they arent trying to sucker me out of a couple hundred, don't think he is cause a friend of mine broke the one in his Grand Am at 100k miles) has the problem been fixed on the 88's having the internally balanced crank?<BR>thanks||||reg||5
